{"unit_id":"Nwflower__dsh-file-claim#card-zh","repo":"Nwflower/dsh-file-claim","commit":"42f07e2171d3781edd932732d243646635f4c1a0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-claim 是面向并行 DSH 会话的文件协作插件，通过注册模型工具、斜杠命令、会话生命周期事件和工具执行前检查接入宿主。会话可认领文件或目录、查看占用并释放认领；其他会话尝试写入活跃认领路径时会收到阻止提示。遇到繁忙文件时，可将编辑内容连同 Git 基线放入待合并区，释放后尝试三路合并，也可查看或丢弃条目。插件还会刷新会话心跳并在会话结束时释放认领，适合多个 agent 同时编辑同一工作区的场景。运行需要 Node.js 18 或更新版本，三路合并需要 git。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:176-268","index.mjs:476-502","index.mjs:529-560","claim.mjs:1032-1080"]}
{"unit_id":"Nwflower__dsh-file-claim#card-en","repo":"Nwflower/dsh-file-claim","commit":"42f07e2171d3781edd932732d243646635f4c1a0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-file-claim coordinates parallel DSH sessions with file claims and pre-write checks. Sessions inspect ownership, release paths, and queue edits to busy files for merging after release. Lifecycle events refresh heartbeats and clear claims when sessions end. Requires Node.js 18+ and git.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:176-268","index.mjs:476-502","index.mjs:529-560","claim.mjs:1032-1080"]}
