{"unit_id":"Nwflower__dsh-file-claim#feature-1","repo":"Nwflower/dsh-file-claim","commit":"42f07e2171d3781edd932732d243646635f4c1a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-claim 的功能「文件认领」：会话可先独占认领文件或目录，其他活跃会话不能再认领重叠路径；调用 claim_files 并传入路径即可登记。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:176-194"]}
{"unit_id":"Nwflower__dsh-file-claim#feature-2","repo":"Nwflower/dsh-file-claim","commit":"42f07e2171d3781edd932732d243646635f4c1a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-claim 的功能「待合并写入」：目标被其他活跃会话占用时，可用 pending_write 保存编辑内容和 Git 基线；释放后可尝试三路合并。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:220-235","claim.mjs:1032-1080"]}
{"unit_id":"Nwflower__dsh-file-claim#feature-3","repo":"Nwflower/dsh-file-claim","commit":"42f07e2171d3781edd932732d243646635f4c1a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-claim 的功能「写入前协调」：工具执行前会检查 write、edit、bash、pwsh 的可识别目标；若路径由其他活跃会话认领，则拒绝本次写入并给出后续处理建议。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:350-435","index.mjs:476-502"]}
{"unit_id":"Nwflower__dsh-file-claim#feature-4","repo":"Nwflower/dsh-file-claim","commit":"42f07e2171d3781edd932732d243646635f4c1a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-claim 的功能「会话状态维护」：agent 创建或状态更新时自动刷新登记，结束时释放其全部认领；定时心跳还会清理过期或孤儿状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:504-560"]}
{"unit_id":"Nwflower__dsh-file-claim#feature-5","repo":"Nwflower/dsh-file-claim","commit":"42f07e2171d3781edd932732d243646635f4c1a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-claim 的功能「审计与 pending 管理」：工具可查询占用和工作区状态，也可查看或丢弃待合并条目；认领与待合并变更写入追加式审计日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:205-262","claim.mjs:1032-1080"]}
{"unit_id":"Nwflower__dsh-file-claim#caveat-1","repo":"Nwflower/dsh-file-claim","commit":"42f07e2171d3781edd932732d243646635f4c1a0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-claim 的使用须知：bash 和 pwsh 仅检查可识别的写命令目标与重定向，无法解析目标时会放行；其他绕过工具执行层的写入不受检查。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:384-385","index.mjs:489-500"]}
